  "notes": [
    "The MLP and backpropagation are implemented from scratch in NumPy (src/ev_battery/model.py), following bp_fit and bp_predict from the course modules.",
    "Sequential search, one factor per stage, not a full factorial design. Validation is reused for selection.",
    "Plain gradient descent is the main optimizer as in the course, Adam is a comparison in the optimizer stage.",
    "max_error stops training when the epoch MSE on the standardised target falls to that value, as in the course bp_fit.",
    "Balancing uses SOH-band sample weights fitted on train, the regression counterpart of class balancing.",
